# Firmware, ROMs, disk images and other large binary artifacts
*.img
*.img.*
*.tar
*.tar.*
*.zip
*.apk
*.mbn
*.ko
*.bin
*.md5
*.pit
*.mdt
*.b0[0-9]
*.b1[0-9]

